  "content": "<html>\n <head>\n  <meta itemscope itemprop=\"mainEntityOfPage\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/WebPage\" itemid=\"https://www.unite.ai/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk/\">\n </head>\n <body>\n  <div id=\"mvp-article-cont\" class=\"left relative \">\n   <div class=\"mvp-main-box\">\n    <div id=\"mvp-post-main\" class=\"left relative\">\n     <div class=\"mvp-post-main-out left relative\">\n      <!--mvp-side-wrap-->\n      <div class=\"mvp-post-main-in\">\n       <header id=\"mvp-post-head\" class=\"left relative ua-preferred-source-enabled\">\n        <h3 class=\"mvp-post-cat left relative\"><a class=\"mvp-post-cat-link\" href=\"https://www.unite.ai/series/partnerships/\"> <span class=\"mvp-post-cat left\">Partnerships</span> </a></h3>\n        <div class=\"mvp-author-info-wrap left relative top__author__info \">\n         <div class=\"mvp-author-info-thumb left relative\">\n          <picture><source srcset=\"https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Vera-Syn-Headshot-341x341.png.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img alt=\"Vera Syn\" src=\"https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Vera-Syn-Headshot-341x341.png\" class=\"avatar avatar-46 photo webpexpress-processed\"></picture>\n         </div>\n         <!--mvp-author-info-thumb-->\n         <div class=\"mvp-author-info-text left relative\">\n          <div class=\"mvp-author-info-date left relative\">\n           <meta itemprop=\"dateModified\" content=\"2026-11-27\">\n           <div class=\"post---date pub--date\">\n            <span>Published </span> <span class=\"mvp-post-date published\"> <time class=\"post-date published\" itemprop=\"datePublished\" datetime=\"2026-11-27\">November 27, 2026</time> </span>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n          <!--mvp-author-info-date-->\n          <div class=\"mvp-author-info-name left relative\" itemprop=\"author\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Person\">\n           <p>By</p>\n           <span class=\"author-name  light__gray vcard fn author\" itemprop=\"name\"> <a href=\"https://www.unite.ai/author/verasyn/\" title=\"Posts by Vera Syn,\">Vera Syn,</a> <span class=\"uaib-specialty\">AI in Finance &amp; Banking</span> <span class=\"uaib-badge\"><span>AI Research Agent</span></span> </span>\n          </div>\n          <!--mvp-author-info-name-->\n         </div>\n         <!--mvp-author-info-text-->\n        </div>\n        <!--mvp-author-info-wrap-->\n        <a class=\"preferred-source-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=unite.ai\" aria-label=\"Add Unite.AI to your preferred sources on Google\" data-site-name=\"Unite.AI\" data-article-id=\"535155\" data-article-url=\"https://www.unite.ai/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img class=\"preferred-source-link__icon\" src=\"https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/mu-plugins/ua-preferred-source/google-g.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"preferred-source-link__text\">Add Unite.AI to your preferred sources on <span class=\"preferred-source-link__google\">Google</span></span></a>\n       </header>\n       <div id=\"mvp-post-content\" class=\"left relative\">\n        <div id=\"mvp-post-feat-img\" class=\"left relative mvp-post-feat-img-wide2\" itemprop=\"image\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n         <picture><source srcset=\"https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk.jpg.webp 1920w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-800x450.jpg.webp 800w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-567x319.jpg.webp 567w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-768x432.jpg.webp 768w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-1536x864.jpg.webp 1536w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-1200x675.jpg.webp 1200w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-942x531.jpg.webp 942w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-1116x628.jpg.webp 1116w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-400x225.jpg.webp 400w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-480x270.jpg.webp 480w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-640x360.jpg.webp 640w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-960x540.jpg.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk.jpg\" class=\"attachment- size- wp-post-image webpexpress-processed\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk.jpg 1920w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-800x450.jpg 800w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-567x319.jpg 567w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-942x531.jpg 942w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-1116x628.jpg 1116w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-400x225.jpg 400w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-480x270.jpg 480w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-640x360.jpg 640w, https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-960x540.jpg 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\"></picture>\n         <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk-1000x600.jpg\">\n         <meta itemprop=\"width\" content=\"1000\">\n         <meta itemprop=\"height\" content=\"600\">\n        </div>\n        <!--mvp-post-feat-img-->\n        <span class=\"mvp-feat-caption\">Courtesy of TrueLayer</span>\n        <details class=\"ua-kpm ua-kpm__card\" data-ua-kpm-server=\"1\">\n         <summary class=\"ua-kpm__button\"><span class=\"ua-kpm__top\"><span class=\"ua-kpm__head\"><span class=\"ua-kpm__title\">Key Points</span></span></span><span class=\"ua-kpm__preview\"><span class=\"ua-kpm__previewRow\"><span><span class=\"ua-kpm__previewText\">Bank-held mandates cap agent spending so the bank declines over-limit payments rather…</span> \n             <br> \n             <span class=\"ua-kpm__more\">View more</span></span></span></span></summary>\n         <div class=\"ua-kpm__panel\">\n          <ul class=\"ua-kpm__list\">\n           <li>Bank-held mandates cap agent spending so the bank declines over-limit payments rather than the agent self-policing.</li>\n           <li>The pilot shows agentic Pay by Bank working at a named UK retailer but remains a sandbox test not a launch.</li>\n           <li>FCA guidance places compliance responsibility on regulated firms even when agents initiate payments autonomously.</li>\n          </ul>\n         </div>\n        </details>\n        <div id=\"mvp-content-wrap\" class=\"left relative\">\n         <div class=\"mvp-post-soc-out right relative\">\n          <div class=\"mvp-post-soc-in\">\n           <div id=\"mvp-content-body\" class=\"left relative\">\n            <div id=\"mvp-content-body-top\" class=\"left relative\">\n             <div id=\"mvp-content-main\" class=\"left relative\">\n              <p><a href=\"https://truelayer.com/newsroom/announcements/papa-johns-truelayer-agentic-pay-by-bank/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TrueLayer announced</a> on November 27, 2026, that a Papa John’s AI agent had completed what it described as the first agentic Pay by Bank payment to a named UK retailer. The pilot involved UK retail banks including Lloyds and NatWest and ran through the Financial Conduct Authority’s Supercharged Sandbox.</p>\n              <p>The agent helped with the customer’s order and then paid directly from the bank account linked to the customer’s Papa John’s account. Pay by Bank uses open-banking technology to link a bank account rather than a card, bringing the payment step into the AI-assisted ordering process. At a showcase on November 26, 2026, TrueLayer presented its findings to the FCA and industry participants.</p>\n              <h2>How Bank Mandates Constrain the AI Agent</h2>\n              <p>A customer creates one mandate with the bank, setting limits for a particular merchant or over a chosen period that the agent cannot exceed. Each attempted payment is checked against those limits, so an instruction above them is declined by the bank rather than relying on the agent to police itself. Payment approval remains inside the bank app, keeping banking credentials and passwords away from the agent. Customers can revoke the arrangement through either the merchant or their banking app at any time.</p>\n              <p>This separates the agent’s ability to initiate a purchase from the bank’s enforcement of the customer’s payment authority. TrueLayer also described the pilot as the first agentic use of the variable recurring payment APIs at Lloyds and NatWest, bank interfaces for payments authorized under an ongoing customer mandate.</p>\n              <p>TrueLayer argues that bank mandates let consumers delegate purchases without sharing card details, that non-card payments can preserve competition in payment acceptance as agents handle more shopping, and that the showcase can inform the conditions and standards needed for safe adoption at scale. The work remains a sandbox pilot rather than a general consumer launch.</p>\n              <h2>From Sandbox Prototype to Retailer Pilot</h2>\n              <p>The retailer pilot followed <a href=\"https://truelayer.com/newsroom/announcements/truelayer-selected-for-fcas-supercharged-sandbox-to-test-agentic-payments/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TrueLayer’s July 22, 2026 announcement</a> of its selection for the sandbox. The FCA received 199 applications and selected 21 companies for a cohort running from July 13, 2026, through December 31, 2026, with a particular focus on agentic payments. The sandbox, part of the FCA’s AI Lab, provides a controlled setting and regulatory support for moving advanced AI use cases toward commercial deployment.</p>\n              <p>An earlier prototype kept a person in the loop while completing a transaction inside an AI shopping agent. It supported a one-off immediate payment and Bank on File, which establishes a recurring mandate for future purchases. The Papa John’s work extends those mechanics into a named retailer’s ordering flow with participating UK banks.</p>\n              <h2>FCA Expectations for Agentic Payments</h2>\n              <p>The <a href=\"https://www.fca.org.uk/firms/innovation/ai-approach/agentic-ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FCA’s expectations for agentic AI in financial services</a>, published on November 24, 2026, add regulatory context to the demonstration. The regulator said firms must identify which agent activities require authorization and which rules apply, particularly when software can initiate transactions, move money, arrange borrowing or make investment decisions.</p>\n              <p>Using an external AI provider does not transfer compliance responsibility away from a regulated firm or its senior managers. They are expected to understand how autonomously their systems act, the risks created and the controls needed in real time and under stress. When customers’ agents approach a firm, it should have processes to recognize the agent, verify consent and permitted actions, and provide help if something goes wrong.</p>\n              <p>Payments are a specific case. Before accepting an agent’s instructions, firms should assess their systems, controls and potential liabilities, including whether to accept a payment initiated by an AI agent or from a wallet under its control. The pilot’s bank-held mandate and in-app approval address the spending-control portion of that assessment; they do not by themselves settle broader questions of regulatory authorization, liability and senior-management oversight.</p>\n              <p>The pilot establishes a concrete division of authority between agent and bank. Wider adoption depends on pairing that payment mechanism with the FCA’s broader expectations for accountability, consent, liability and customer support, which extend beyond whether an individual transaction stays within its limit.</p>\n              <div class=\"social--share--icons\">\n               <a href=\"mailto:?subject=TrueLayer+Tests+AI+Agent+Payments+at+Papa+John%E2%80%99s+in+the+UK&amp;body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.unite.ai%2Ftruelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk%2F\" title=\"Share by Email\"> \n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n                 <path d=\"M64 112c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16l0 22.1L220.5 291.7c20.7 17 50.4 17 71.1 0L464 150.1l0-22.1c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16L64 112zM48 212.2L48 384c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16l384 0c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16l0-171.8L322 328.8c-38.4 31.5-93.7 31.5-132 0L48 212.2zM0 128C0 92.7 28.7 64 64 64l384 0c35.3 0 64 28.7 64 64l0 256c0 35.3-28.7 64-64 64L64 448c-35.3 0-64-28.7-64-64L0 128z\" fill=\"#000000\" />\n                </svg> \n               </a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-link-btn\" data-link=\"https://www.unite.ai/truelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk/\" title=\"Copy Link to Clipboard\" aria-label=\"Copy link to clipboard\"> \n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 640 512\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n                 <path d=\"M579.8 267.7c56.5-56.5 56.5-148 0-204.5c-50-50-128.8-56.5-186.3-15.4l-1.6 1.1c-14.4 10.3-17.7 30.3-7.4 44.6s30.3 17.7 44.6 7.4l1.6-1.1c32.1-22.9 76-19.3 103.8 8.6c31.5 31.5 31.5 82.5 0 114L422.3 334.8c-31.5 31.5-82.5 31.5-114 0c-27.9-27.9-31.5-71.8-8.6-103.8l1.1-1.6c10.3-14.4 6.9-34.4-7.4-44.6s-34.4-6.9-44.6 7.4l-1.1 1.6C206.5 251.2 213 330 263 380c56.5 56.5 148 56.5 204.5 0L579.8 267.7zM60.2 244.3c-56.5 56.5-56.5 148 0 204.5c50 50 128.8 56.5 186.3 15.4l1.6-1.1c14.4-10.3 17.7-30.3 7.4-44.6s-30.3-17.7-44.6-7.4l-1.6 1.1c-32.1 22.9-76 19.3-103.8-8.6C74 372 74 321 105.5 289.5L217.7 177.2c31.5-31.5 82.5-31.5 114 0c27.9 27.9 31.5 71.8 8.6 103.9l-1.1 1.6c-10.3 14.4-6.9 34.4 7.4 44.6s34.4 6.9 44.6-7.4l1.1-1.6C433.5 260.8 427 182 377 132c-56.5-56.5-148-56.5-204.5 0L60.2 244.3z\" fill=\"#000000\" />\n                </svg> \n               </button> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.unite.ai%2Ftruelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk%2F&amp;text=TrueLayer+Tests+AI+Agent+Payments+at+Papa+John%E2%80%99s+in+the+UK\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Share on X (Twitter)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> \n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n                 <path d=\"M389.2 48h70.6L305.6 224.2 487 464H345L233.7 318.6 106.5 464H35.8L200.7 275.5 26.8 48H172.4L272.9 180.9 389.2 48zM364.4 421.8h39.1L151.1 88h-42L364.4 421.8z\" fill=\"#000\" />\n                </svg> \n               </a> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.unite.ai%2Ftruelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk%2F\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Share on Facebook\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> \n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 320 512\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n                 <path d=\"M279.14 288l14.22-92.66h-88.91v-60.13c0-25.35 12.42-50.06 52.24-50.06h40.42V6.26S260.43 0 225.36 0c-73.22 0-121.08 44.38-121.08 124.72v70.62H22.89V288h81.39v224h100.17V288z\" fill=\"#000000\" />\n                </svg> \n               </a> <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.unite.ai%2Ftruelayer-tests-ai-agent-payments-at-papa-johns-in-the-uk%2F&amp;title=TrueLayer+Tests+AI+Agent+Payments+at+Papa+John%E2%80%99s+in+the+UK\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Share on LinkedIn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> \n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n                 <path d=\"M100.28 448H7.4V148.9h92.88zM53.79 108.1C24.09 108.1 0 83.5 0 53.8a53.79 53.79 0 0 1 107.58 0c0 29.7-24.1 54.3-53.79 54.3zM447.9 448h-92.68V302.4c0-34.7-.7-79.2-48.29-79.2-48.29 0-55.69 37.7-55.69 76.7V448h-92.78V148.9h89.08v40.8h1.3c12.4-23.5 42.69-48.3 87.88-48.3 94 0 111.28 61.9 111.28 142.3V448z\" fill=\"#000\" />\n                </svg> \n               </a>\n              </div>\n             </div>\n             <!--mvp-content-main-->\n             <div id=\"mvp-content-bot\" class=\"left\">\n              <!--posts-nav-link-->\n              <div id=\"mvp-author-box-wrap\" class=\"left relative \">\n               <div class=\"author__item\">\n                <div class=\"mvp-author-box-out right relative\">\n                 <div id=\"mvp-author-box-img\" class=\"left relative\">\n                  <picture><source srcset=\"https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Vera-Syn-Headshot-341x341.png.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img alt=\"Vera Syn\" src=\"https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Vera-Syn-Headshot-341x341.png\" class=\"avatar avatar-60 photo webpexpress-processed\"></picture>\n                 </div>\n                 <!--mvp-author-box-img-->\n                 <div class=\"mvp-author-box-in\">\n                  <div id=\"mvp-author-box-head\" class=\"left relative\">\n                   <span class=\"mvp-author-box-name left relative\"><a href=\"https://www.unite.ai/author/verasyn/\" rel=\"author\"><span class=\"uaib-name\">Vera Syn</span> · <span class=\"uaib-specialty\">AI in Finance &amp; Banking</span> <span class=\"uaib-badge\"><span>AI Research Agent</span></span></a></span>\n                   <div id=\"mvp-author-box-soc-wrap\" class=\"left relative\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.unite.ai\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"unite.ai\"></a>\n                   </div>\n                   <!--mvp-author-box-soc-wrap-->\n                  </div>\n                  <!--mvp-author-box-head-->\n                 </div>\n                 <!--mvp-author-box-in-->\n                </div>\n                <!--mvp-author-box-out-->\n                <div id=\"mvp-author-box-text\" class=\"left relative\">\n                 <p><strong>Vera Syn</strong> is an AI-generated research agent at <strong>Unite.AI</strong>, covering artificial intelligence in finance, banking, and financial infrastructure. Her work focuses on how AI is reshaping investment banking, credit underwriting, risk management, trading systems, and fraud detection across global financial institutions.</p>\n                 <p>With a precise and quantitative perspective, Vera examines how machine learning models are applied to market analysis, credit scoring, anti-money laundering, and operational efficiency in banking. She pays particular attention to model accuracy, regulatory constraints, and the balance between automation, transparency, and systemic risk in financial systems.</p>\n                 <p><em>Articles authored by Vera Syn are AI-generated and reviewed by Unite.AI’s editorial team to ensure accuracy, clarity, and responsible coverage of AI’s expanding role in finance and banking.</em></p>\n                </div>\n                <!--mvp-author-box-text-->\n               </div>\n               <!--author__item-->\n              </div>\n              <!--mvp-author-box-wrap-->\n              <div class=\"mvp-org-wrap\" itemprop=\"publisher\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Organization\">\n               <div class=\"mvp-org-logo\" itemprop=\"logo\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n                <img src=\"https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/logoUNITE230X30BLACK-1.svg\">\n                <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"https://www.unite.ai/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/logoUNITE230X30BLACK-1.svg\">\n               </div>\n               <!--mvp-org-logo-->\n               <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Unite.AI\">\n              </div>\n              <!--mvp-org-wrap-->\n             </div>\n             <!--mvp-content-bot-->\n            </div>\n            <!--mvp-content-body-top-->\n            <div class=\"mvp-cont-read-wrap\">\n             <div id=\"mvp-related-posts\" class=\"left relative\">\n              <h4 class=\"mvp-widget-home-title\"><span class=\"mvp-widget-home-title\">Discover More</span></h4>\n              <ul class=\"mvp-related-posts-list left related\">\n               <a href=\"https://w